---
title: Invalid Missing Id Field
type: app
status: active
created: "2026-07-15"
---

# Invalid: model without an id-capable key

The `Tag` model defines no `id` field, so crud generators (whose id column
defaults to `id`) could not persist it. Validation rejects the spec instead
of letting generation fail later.

::app[name=missing-id port=8080]

:::model[name=User]
- id: uuid [primary, auto]
- email: email [required, unique]
:::

:::model[name=Tag]
- label: string [required, max=40]
- color: string [optional]
:::

:::auth[provider=email]
session: cookie
:::

::
